  "content": [
    {
      "text": "king of Assyria … carried them captive to Assyria, 2 Kgs. 15:29. carried he into captivity from Jerusalem to Babylon, 2 Kgs. 24:15. Zedekiah … and carried him to Babylon, 2 Kgs. 25:7. Nebuchadnezzar sent, and brought him to Babylon, 2 Chr. 36:10. carried he away to Babylon, 2 Chr. 36:20. flee ye from the Chaldeans, with a voice of singing, Isa. 48:20 (Jer. 50:8; 1 Ne. 20:20). I will deliver Zedekiah … into the hand of Nebuchadrezzar, Jer. 21:7. king of Babylon … will bring them against this land, Jer. 25:9. he shall lead Zedekiah to Babylon, Jer. 32:5 (52:11; Omni 1:15). thou shalt not escape … thou shalt go to Babylon, Jer. 34:3. I was among the captives by the river of Chebar, Ezek. 1:1. I will bring him to Babylon, Ezek. 12:13 (17:20). in the midst of Babylon he shall die, Ezek. 17:16. carried into the land of Shinar, Dan. 1:2.",
